[sliver] Functional spring-hook catch faces: the 0.85 mm reach is 0.60 mm engagement plus 0.25 mm running allowance. Each free spring wall is 3 mm thick, and the flat underside bears on the seat ledge after insertion. The narrow face is the specified retaining projection. Tree(auto)/Default supplies supports through the cap’s open mouth before assembly.
alternatives: Removing or sloping this bearing lets the hook cam off its ledge. Increasing the reach to 3 mm requires another 2.15 mm of spring travel and wider seat pockets; increasing vertical wall stock does not change the measured horizontal catch face.
